# Frontend environment
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL — where the app sends API requests.
#
#   /api   (default, recommended)
#          Same server that serves the app. In development the Vite dev server forwards
#          /api to http://localhost:8000 (see vite.config.js); in production the Node
#          server serves both the app and the API. Works on any host name or LAN IP.
#
#   https://api.yourdomain.com/api
#          Only if the API is hosted on a different domain than the app. Then also add
#          the app's URL to CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS in backend/.env.
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
